---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../styles/global.css';
import '../styles/hub.css';
import '../styles/brand-refresh.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="boomley — problems become signals" description="boomley is a two-person product company and growing community for turning meaningful problems into products worth building.">
  <div class="hub-loader" data-loader aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="hub-loader__progress"><span data-loader-count>000</span><small>%</small></div>
    <div class="hub-loader__copy">
      <p data-loader-line>WE ALL HAVE THEM.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hub-loader__mark" data-loader-mark>
      <span class="hub-loader__b">b</span><span class="hub-loader__rest">oomley</span>
    </div>
    <p class="hub-loader__welcome" data-loader-welcome>WELCOME.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="cursor" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>

  <header class="hub-nav" data-hub-nav>
    <a class="hub-brand" href="#top" aria-label="boomley home">
      <svg class="hub-symbol" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="13"></circle>
        <path d="M16 3v26M3 16h26"></path>
        <path d="M16 16 29 3"></path>
      </svg>
      <span>boomley</span>
    </a>

    <nav class="hub-nav__links" aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#process">Process</a>
      <a href="#builds">Builds</a>
      <a href="#community">Community</a>
      <a href="#signal-box">Signal</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="hub-nav__meta">
      <span>EST. 2026</span>
      <span class="hub-live-dot">BUILDING</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="top">
    <section class="hub-hero">
      <div class="hub-hero__copy">
        <p class="hub-eyebrow" data-hub-reveal>A PRODUCT COMPANY / A PUBLIC WORKBENCH / A GROWING COMMUNITY</p>
        <h1 data-hub-hero-title>
          PROBLEMS<br />
          ARE <em>EVERYWHERE.</em><br />
          WE PAY ATTENTION.
        </h1>
        <p class="hub-hero__deck" data-hub-reveal>
          boomley notices the problems people keep learning to live with — then investigates the ones worth turning into products.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-hero__art" data-hub-hero-art>
        <div class="hub-hero__portrait hub-hero__portrait--one" data-founder-card="chidi">
          <img class="hub-founder-shot" src="/media/founders/chidi.webp" alt="Chidi, Product" width="2048" height="2048" />
          <span>PRODUCT</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hub-hero__portrait hub-hero__portrait--two" data-founder-card="michael">
          <img class="hub-founder-shot" src="/media/founders/michael.webp" alt="Michael, Engineering" width="2048" height="2048" />
          <span>ENGINEERING</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hub-hero__stamp">TWO PEOPLE.<br />FOR NOW.</div>
        <div class="hub-hero__signal">SIGNAL<br />RECEIVER</div>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-hero__bottom">
        <span>02 PEOPLE</span>
        <span>01 ACTIVE BUILD</span>
        <span>THE BOX IS OPEN</span>
        <a href="#about">ENTER ↓</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="hub-story hub-dark">
      <div class="hub-section-label">01 / ABOUT</div>

      <div class="hub-story__track" data-story-track>
        <article class="hub-story__beat is-first">
          <span>01</span>
          <h2>IT STARTS<br />WITH A <em>PROBLEM.</em></h2>
          <p>Something takes too long. Feels unnecessarily difficult. Makes people invent workarounds.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="hub-story__beat">
          <span>02</span>
          <h2>THEN A<br /><em>THOUGHT.</em></h2>
          <p>Why does it work this way? Why has everybody accepted it?</p>
        </article>

        <article class="hub-story__beat">
          <span>03</span>
          <h2>THEN AN<br /><em>IDEA.</em></h2>
          <p>Not necessarily a product yet. Just the possibility that something could be better.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="hub-story__beat is-signal">
          <span>04</span>
          <h2>THEN A<br /><em>SIGNAL.</em></h2>
          <p>When the pattern repeats, boomley starts listening more closely.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-story__resolution" data-story-resolution>
        <span>PROBLEM → THOUGHT → IDEA → SIGNAL</span>
        <h3>boomley</h3>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="process" class="hub-process">
      <div class="hub-section-label">02 / HOW WE WORK</div>
      <div class="hub-process__intro">
        <h2 data-hub-reveal>WE DON'T START<br />WITH <em>APPS.</em></h2>
        <p data-hub-reveal>We start by asking whether the problem deserves one.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-process__rail" data-process-rail>
        <article>
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>NOTICE</h3>
          <p>Find repeated friction rather than isolated annoyance.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>LISTEN</h3>
          <p>Understand who experiences it and what it costs them.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>QUESTION</h3>
          <p>Decide whether software should exist at all.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>04</span>
          <h3>BUILD</h3>
          <p>Product and engineering turn the strongest signal into something tangible.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>05</span>
          <h3>TEST</h3>
          <p>Reality gets the final vote.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>06</span>
          <h3>LISTEN AGAIN</h3>
          <p>The loop starts over.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="history" class="hub-history hub-blue">
      <div class="hub-section-label">03 / HISTORY</div>
      <div class="hub-history__intro">
        <h2 data-hub-reveal>YOU FOUND US<br /><em>EARLY.</em></h2>
        <p data-hub-reveal>No mythology. No fake milestones. Just the actual beginning.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-history__timeline" data-history-timeline>
        <article class="is-done">
          <span>2026</span>
          <h3>TWO DISCIPLINES MEET.</h3>
          <p>Product management and software engineering begin exploring recurring frustrations together.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="is-done">
          <span>SIGNAL / 001</span>
          <h3>RESEARCH BEGINS.</h3>
          <p>The first problem becomes serious enough to document rather than just discuss.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="is-now">
          <span>NOW</span>
          <h3>BUILDING IN PUBLIC.</h3>
          <p>Research, systems, experience design and the first private build are taking shape.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>NEXT</span>
          <h3>TEST WITH PEOPLE.</h3>
          <p>Let real users challenge the assumptions before anything deserves a launch.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="people" class="hub-people">
      <div class="hub-section-label">04 / PEOPLE</div>
      <div class="hub-people__intro">
        <h2 data-hub-reveal>WHO'S ACTUALLY<br />OPENING THE BOX?</h2>
        <p data-hub-reveal>Two people. Two disciplines. One shared intolerance for unnecessary friction.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-people__grid">
        <article class="hub-person" tabindex="0" data-hub-person data-founder="chidi">
          <div class="hub-person__media">
            <img class="hub-person__photo" src="/media/founders/chidi.webp" alt="Chidi" width="2048" height="2048" />
            <canvas class="hub-person__ascii" data-hub-ascii data-founder="chidi" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
            <div class="hub-person__overlay">
              <span>01 / PRODUCT</span>
              <strong>ASKS<br />WHY.</strong>
              <small>SOCIAL / TO ADD</small>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="hub-person__meta">
            <b>CHIDI</b>
            <span>Product management / strategy / research / experience</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="hub-person" tabindex="0" data-hub-person data-founder="michael">
          <div class="hub-person__media">
            <img class="hub-person__photo" src="/media/founders/michael.webp" alt="Michael" width="2048" height="2048" />
            <canvas class="hub-person__ascii" data-hub-ascii data-founder="michael" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
            <div class="hub-person__overlay">
              <span>02 / ENGINEERING</span>
              <strong>MAKES<br />IT REAL.</strong>
              <small>SOCIAL / TO ADD</small>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="hub-person__meta">
            <b>MICHAEL</b>
            <span>Software engineering / systems / architecture / build</span>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="builds" class="hub-builds hub-dark">
      <div class="hub-section-label">05 / BUILDS</div>
      <div class="hub-builds__intro">
        <p class="hub-eyebrow" data-hub-reveal>WE FOUND OUR FIRST SIGNAL.</p>
        <h2 data-hub-reveal>1000001</h2>
        <p class="hub-builds__deck" data-hub-reveal>We're not explaining it yet. We're documenting it, questioning it and building it.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-builds__evidence">
        <div class="hub-evidence hub-evidence--paper" data-hub-reveal>
          <span>RESEARCH / 001</span>
          <b>ATTENTION WAS FRAGMENTED BEFORE WE TRIED TO FIX IT.</b>
          <p>Research artifact / selected note</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hub-evidence hub-evidence--screen" data-hub-reveal>
          <div class="hub-screen-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>private build</span></div>
          <strong>ONE THING.<br />STAY WITH IT.</strong>
          <small>1000001 / INTERNAL</small>
        </div>

        <div class="hub-evidence hub-evidence--note" data-hub-reveal>
          <span>RULE / 07</span>
          <b>THE TOOL SHOULD NOT BECOME THE TASK.</b>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-builds__status">
        <div><span>RESEARCH</span><b>COMPLETE</b></div>
        <div><span>DOCUMENTATION</span><b>ACTIVE</b></div>
        <div><span>EXPERIENCE</span><b>ACTIVE</b></div>
        <div><span>BUILD</span><b>NEXT</b></div>
        <div><span>TEST</span><b>LATER</b></div>
      </div>

      <form class="hub-builds__waitlist" name="product-1000001" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" data-netlify-form>
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="product-1000001" />
        <p class="honeypot"><label>Do not fill this out: <input name="bot-field" /></label></p>
        <label for="product-email">Want to be there when 1000001 opens?</label>
        <div>
          <input id="product-email" type="email" name="email" placeholder="ENTER EMAIL" autocomplete="email" required />
          <button type="submit">KEEP ME CLOSE ↗</button>
        </div>
        <p class="form-status" data-product-form-status aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
    </section>

    <section id="community" class="hub-community">
      <div class="hub-section-label">06 / COMMUNITY</div>
      <div class="hub-community__headline">
        <h2 data-hub-reveal>SOME PEOPLE<br /><em>NOTICE THINGS.</em></h2>
        <h2 data-hub-reveal>SOME PEOPLE<br /><em>BUILD THEM.</em></h2>
        <p data-hub-reveal>We want both.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-community__field" data-community-field aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="hub-community__copy" data-hub-reveal>
        <p>boomley is becoming a home for problem-noticers, developers, designers, researchers, students, founders and people who are simply curious enough to ask why something still works this way.</p>
        <a href="#signal-box">I HAVE A PROBLEM →</a>
        <a href="mailto:hello@boomley.com">I WANT TO BUILD →</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="signal-box" class="hub-signal hub-mist">
      <div class="hub-section-label">07 / SEND A SIGNAL</div>
      <div class="hub-signal__intro">
        <h2 data-hub-reveal>WHAT HAVE<br /><em>YOU</em> NOTICED?</h2>
        <div data-hub-reveal>
          <strong><span>01</span> WRITE THE PROBLEM.</strong>
          <strong><span>02</span> WRAP THE LETTER.</strong>
          <strong><span>03</span> POST IT.</strong>
          <p>Don't pitch us an app. Tell us what shouldn't still be this difficult.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hub-signal__workspace">
        <form class="hub-letter" name="boomley-signal" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" data-hub-signal-form>
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="boomley-signal" />
          <p class="honeypot"><label>Do not fill this out: <input name="bot-field" /></label></p>
          <div class="hub-letter__meta"><span>boomley / signal form</span><span>001</span></div>
          <h3>WHAT'S BOTHERING YOU?</h3>
          <p>Write the problem. We'll worry about the product.</p>

          <label>THE PROBLEM
            <textarea name="friction" rows="4" required placeholder="It shouldn't still be this difficult to..."></textarea>
          </label>
          <label>WHO DEALS WITH IT?
            <input name="who" type="text" required placeholder="People who..." />
          </label>
          <label>WHAT CHANGES IF IT'S FIXED?
            <textarea name="change" rows="2" required placeholder="It would make it easier to..."></textarea>
          </label>
          <label>YOUR EMAIL
            <input name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" />
          </label>

          <div class="hub-letter__actions">
            <button type="button" data-hub-wrap>WRAP IT →</button>
            <button type="submit" data-hub-post disabled>POST IT →</button>
          </div>
          <p class="form-status" data-hub-signal-status aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>

        <div class="hub-posting">
          <div class="hub-envelope" data-hub-envelope aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="hub-envelope__paper">SIGNAL / READY</div>
            <div class="hub-envelope__flap"></div>
            <span>TO / boomley</span>
          </div>

          <div class="hub-postbox" data-hub-postbox aria-label="boomley Signal Box">
            <div class="hub-postbox__top"></div>
            <div class="hub-postbox__body">
              <div class="hub-postbox__badge">b</div>
              <div class="hub-postbox__slot"><span>POST SIGNAL</span></div>
              <div class="hub-postbox__plaque"><b>boomley</b><small>SIGNAL RECEIVER / 001</small></div>
              <div class="hub-postbox__door"><span>THE BOX IS OPEN</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="hub-postbox__base"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="hub-ending hub-dark">
      <canvas class="hub-ending__field" data-hub-ending-field aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
      <div class="hub-ending__copy">
        <span>SIGNALS EXIST EVERYWHERE.</span>
        <h2 data-hub-reveal>THIS IS ONLY<br /><em>THE BEGINNING.</em></h2>
        <p data-hub-reveal>We're listening.</p>
        <div class="hub-ending__brand" data-hub-reveal>
          <svg class="hub-symbol hub-symbol--large" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true">
            <circle cx="16" cy="16" r="13"></circle>
            <path d="M16 3v26M3 16h26"></path>
            <path d="M16 16 29 3"></path>
          </svg>
          <b>boomley</b>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="hub-footer">
    <div class="hub-footer__brand">
      <b>boomley</b>
      <p>Problems become signals. Signals become things.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span>EXPLORE</span>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#process">Process</a>
      <a href="#history">History</a>
      <a href="#builds">Builds</a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span>PARTICIPATE</span>
      <a href="#community">Community</a>
      <a href="#signal-box">Send a Signal</a>
      <a href="mailto:hello@boomley.com">Contact</a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span>LEGAL</span>
      <a href="#">Privacy</a>
      <a href="#">Terms</a>
      <small>© 2026 boomley</small>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    import '../scripts/hub.ts';
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
